{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"id":1,"title":2,"inWords":3,"equation":4,"parameters":5,"outputs":9,"results":11,"assumptions":14,"buildsOn":17,"sameDomain":21,"citation":40,"learnMore":41},"signal-latency","Latence du signal","La vitesse de la lumière impose un coût : Δt = 2h/c pour l'aller-retour. Les orbites basses répondent en millisecondes ; les 36 000 km de GEO coûtent un quart de seconde — voilà pourquoi la voix par GEO semble lente.","\u003Cspan class=\"katex-display\">\u003Cspan class=\"katex\">\u003Cspan class=\"katex-mathml\">\u003Cmath xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\">\u003Csemantics>\u003Cmrow>\u003Cmi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ\u003C/mi>\u003Cmi>t\u003C/mi>\u003Cmo>=\u003C/mo>\u003Cmn>2\u003C/mn>\u003Cmi>h\u003C/mi>\u003Cmi mathvariant=\"normal\">/\u003C/mi>\u003Cmi>c\u003C/mi>\u003C/mrow>\u003Cannotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t = 2h / c\u003C/annotation>\u003C/semantics>\u003C/math>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003Cspan class=\"katex-base\">\u003Cspan class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mord\">Δ\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mord mathnormal\">t\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mrel\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\">\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"katex-base\">\u003Cspan class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mord\">2\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mord mathnormal\">h\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mord\">/\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mord mathnormal\">c\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>",[6],{"label":7,"value":8},"Altitude [km]","35 790 (100 – 40 000)",[10],"Délai aller-retour (ms)",[12],{"label":10,"value":13},"238,7",[15,16],"Trajet en ligne droite (satellite au zénith)","Signal à la vitesse de la lu